### HRPro API - file test cho VS Code REST Client / Thunder Client
@host = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Dang nhap
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

### Thong tin tai khoan
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Danh sach nhan vien
GET {{host}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Them nhan vien
POST {{host}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeCode": "NV100",
  "name": "Nguyen Van Test",
  "email": "test@hrpro.vn",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "position": "Developer",
  "salary": 15000000,
  "joinedAt": "2026-01-15",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "departmentId": 1
}

### Sua nhan vien
PUT {{host}}/employees/26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salary": 17000000, "position": "Senior Developer" }

### Xoa nhan vien
DELETE {{host}}/employees/26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Phong ban
GET {{host}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ca lam viec
GET {{host}}/shifts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cham cong - tao
POST {{host}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employeeId": 1, "shiftId": 1, "date": "2026-09-21", "checkIn": "08:10", "checkOut": "17:00" }

### Cham cong - danh sach theo thang
GET {{host}}/attendance?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tinh luong thang
POST {{host}}/payroll/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "month": "2026-09" }

### Bang luong theo thang
GET {{host}}/payroll/2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Khoa bang luong
POST {{host}}/payroll/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "month": "2026-09" }

### Them KPI
POST {{host}}/kpi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employeeId": 1, "period": "2026-08", "sales": 85, "attendance": 95, "task": 88, "deadline": 90, "quality": 92 }

### Danh sach KPI
GET {{host}}/kpi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
